Two independent parts. Both are needed: part 1 fixes the two guessable URLs, part 2 fixes every other wrong path.

PART 1 — serve the extensionless paths. Edit C:/projects/hometongue/vercel.json to add a "rewrites" array alongside the existing "functions" block:

{
  "functions": {
    "api/analyze.js": { "maxDuration": 60 }
  },
  "rewrites": [
    { "source": "/game",    "destination": "/game.html" },
    { "source": "/privacy", "destination": "/privacy.html" }
