SECONDARY FIX (recommended — treats the cause, not just the symptom). `minmax` alone leaves a 19px scrubber at 320px and 0px at 280px. (0px is inert rather than broken: scrubTo early-returns on `if (!rect.width) return;`.) The root problem is that 281px of fixed dock chrome — 34 + 50 + 34 + 85 buttons, 4 x 12px gaps, 2 x 14px padding, 2 x 1px border — cannot fit a usable scrubber in a 300px dock. Reclaim room by dropping the two +/-5s buttons at narrow widths; they are a nicety, and arrow keys (js/game.js:476) and the bar itself still seek:

